<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- One part, three complete bars, proving divisions and time signature
     are tracked as they change (A6, Ref 18) rather than read once from
     the first match in the whole document:
       M1  4/4, divisions=4  - C D E F, all quarter notes (ts_duration 1.0)
       M2  6/8, divisions=4  - G A quarter, B C5 eighth (ts_duration 2.0/1.0)
       M3  4/4, divisions=8  - D5 E5 F5 G5, all quarter notes (ts_duration
           1.0 again). Divisions doubles here - if a stale divisions=4 were
           used, an 8-division quarter note would wrongly read as 2.0.
     Every bar is rhythmically complete so pickup detection does not fire. -->
